  "title": "Envela to Present at the 17th Annual Southwest IDEAS Investor Conference",
  "summary": "IRVING, TX / ACCESS Newswire / November 17, 2025 / Envela Corporation (“Envela” or the “Company”) today announced that it will present at the Southwest IDEAS Investor Conference on Thursday, November 20, 2025, at The Westin Las Colinas in Dallas, TX. The Company’s presentation is scheduled to begin at 11:15 AM CT. A live webcast […]",
